# k=10 2-tier leaf-spine: 250 hosts, 25 spines (25 paths), 1:1 oversubscription
# 10 ToRs x 25 hosts/ToR, each ToR fully-connected to all 25 spines.
Nodes 250
Tiers 2
Podsize 250

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 25
Radix_Up 25
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 10
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
